{"stored_at": "2026-03-18T18:02:54.912226", "expires_at": "2026-03-19T18:02:54.912226", "value": {"type": "game", "name": "Solasta II", "steam_appid": 2975950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4045820], "detailed_description": "<h1>Current Early Access Content </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/4674ed24a42199293f49f5bb0c3e8e45.avif?t=1773413496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras_big/4674ed24a42199293f49f5bb0c3e8e45.avif?t=1773413496 width=1560 height=950 /></span></p></p><br><h1>План дій</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/4d68522ed842f1fcf6c452ee45c37c96.avif?t=1773413496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras_big/4d68522ed842f1fcf6c452ee45c37c96.webp?t=1773413496 width=1560 height=769 /></span><br><i>This roadmap presents the Early Access plan as of March 2026 and does not include all planned content.<br>Features and updates not yet implemented are subject to change and evolve.</i></p></p><br><h1>Про гру</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From the creators of Solasta: Crown of the Magister comes another intriguing tactical RPG faithful to the world's most popular TTRPG's ruleset.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/883a57807553ff07f4a66c0c4e8966ae.poster.avif?t=1773413496\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/883a57807553ff07f4a66c0c4e8966ae.webm?t=1773413496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/883a57807553ff07f4a66c0c4e8966ae.mp4?t=1773413496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/496910ba862f20e8926c24cb6554ae67.avif?t=1773413496\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and guide your party of 4 adventurers as they head to the faraway continent of Neokos in a quest driven by their family legacy. In the face of the threat by the ancient and enigmatic Shadwyn, what choices will you make to push back the impending tide of corruption?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solasta II is a grand sequel to Solasta: Crown of the Magister, a much beloved Tactical RPG known for its faithfulness to the Tabletop experience. Decades after defeating the Sorak menace, a new flegdling party of heroes travels to distant lands in search for redemption. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/a075ac24e625eaa17683d79eb46fd4e5.poster.avif?t=1773413496\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/a075ac24e625eaa17683d79eb46fd4e5.webm?t=1773413496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/a075ac24e625eaa17683d79eb46fd4e5.mp4?t=1773413496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/f15a8eeedc128a4b36d1696866dbfab0.avif?t=1773413496\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solasta II remains true to its promise to deliver gameplay based on the world's most popular TTRPG. Prepare your spells, land that sneak attack, smite this monster - bathe in the familiarity of your Tabletop experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that's not all Solasta II will have to offer. This new opus will also allow you to freely roam the lands of Neokos, to explore and uncover the map as you will. Whether you stick to familiar roads, or head off into the wilderness... The choice is yours. Just be careful - because as we've always said...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You make the choices, dice decide your destiny.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From the creators of Solasta: Crown of the Magister comes another intriguing tactical RPG faithful to the world's most popular TTRPG's ruleset.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/883a57807553ff07f4a66c0c4e8966ae.poster.avif?t=1773413496\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/883a57807553ff07f4a66c0c4e8966ae.webm?t=1773413496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/883a57807553ff07f4a66c0c4e8966ae.mp4?t=1773413496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/496910ba862f20e8926c24cb6554ae67.avif?t=1773413496\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and guide your party of 4 adventurers as they head to the faraway continent of Neokos in a quest driven by their family legacy. In the face of the threat by the ancient and enigmatic Shadwyn, what choices will you make to push back the impending tide of corruption?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solasta II is a grand sequel to Solasta: Crown of the Magister, a much beloved Tactical RPG known for its faithfulness to the Tabletop experience. Decades after defeating the Sorak menace, a new flegdling party of heroes travels to distant lands in search for redemption. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/a075ac24e625eaa17683d79eb46fd4e5.poster.avif?t=1773413496\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/a075ac24e625eaa17683d79eb46fd4e5.webm?t=1773413496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/a075ac24e625eaa17683d79eb46fd4e5.mp4?t=1773413496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/extras/f15a8eeedc128a4b36d1696866dbfab0.avif?t=1773413496\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solasta II remains true to its promise to deliver gameplay based on the world's most popular TTRPG. Prepare your spells, land that sneak attack, smite this monster - bathe in the familiarity of your Tabletop experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that's not all Solasta II will have to offer. This new opus will also allow you to freely roam the lands of Neokos, to explore and uncover the map as you will. Whether you stick to familiar roads, or head off into the wilderness... The choice is yours. Just be careful - because as we've always said...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You make the choices, dice decide your destiny.</p>", "short_description": "In a Mana-infused land, a dark force led by the enigmatic Shadwyn threatens Neokos. Bring your party of adventurers together across perilous realms in this Turn-Based Tactical RPG based on the SRD 5.2 ruleset. You make the choices, dice decide your destiny.", "supported_languages": "англійська<strong>*</strong>, французька, італійська, німецька, іспанська (Іспанія), польська, португальська (Бразилія), російська, китайська (спрощена)<br><strong>*</strong>повністю озвучено цими мовами", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/header.jpg?t=1773413496", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/af1dc02431cdfae5c644773cc0714a8128b45fc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773413496", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975950/af1dc02431cdfae5c644773cc0714a8128b45fc7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773413496", "website": "https://www.solasta-game.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Мінімальні:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Потребує 64-бітних процесора та операційної системи<br></li><li><strong>ОС:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Процесор:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700K / AMD Ryzen 5 2600X<br></li><li><strong>Оперативна пам’ять:</strong> 16 GB ОП<br></li><li><strong>Відеокарта:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 8 GB / AMD Radeon 5700 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> версії 12<br></li><li><strong>Місце на диску:</strong> 40 GB доступного місця<br></li><li><strong>Додаткові примітки:</strong> SSD required</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Рекомендовані:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Потребує 64-бітних процесора та операційної системи<br></li><li><strong>ОС:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Процесор:</strong> Intel Core i7-13700K / AMD Ryzen 9 7900X<br></li><li><strong>Оперативна пам’ять:</strong> 16 GB ОП<br></li><li><strong>Відеокарта:</strong> Nvidia GeForce 2070 10 GB / AMD Radeon 5700 16 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> версії 12<br></li><li><strong>Місце на диску:</strong> 40 GB доступного місця<br></li><li><strong>Додаткові приміт